::SPEECH_U05_L05_GuidedPractice_Q01::
Question ID: SPEECH_U05_L05_GuidedPractice_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.SPEECH.COM.07
Question:
Which sentence has the most constructive audience impact?
{
~A. Use a word that sounds harsh for the audience#This choice does not fit the audience or purpose clearly enough. Check how word meaning or digital structure affects the listener.
=B. Students should use group work time more purposefully#Correct. This choice supports clear, audience-aware communication through precise word meaning or coherent digital presentation design.
~C. Ignore the feeling a word creates#This choice reflects a misconception. Recheck tone, word meaning, slide organization, or presentation coherence.
~D. Use a word with the wrong direct meaning#This choice weakens the presentation because it ignores how the audience understands the message.
}
